We cannot have a solution $k$ since the statement in question is clearly false.
Therefore, we also have
\begin{align*}
(n+1)& \neq 29
\end{align*}
and we cannot find an integer $k$. 
We have found our first time out of line integer $n$, where $n = 29$ 
